      "body": "The exact-head preview confirms the encoded-handle close fix works. The tester found a follow-up UX issue: the tab still waits for the roughly 0.5-second PTY teardown request before disappearing. That optimistic-close polish, plus the related terminal inset and macOS scrollbar-idle behavior, is tracked in [#4539](https://github.com/Untrivial-ai/agent-orchestrator/issues/4539) and is being fixed on [PR #4473](https://github.com/Untrivial-ai/agent-orchestrator/pull/4473).",
